# Wave T53 (Brightshore kit): coilcradle — the tale's spare coil on its cradle: three copper rings wound on a wooden A-frame cradle at the Lighthouse's east shoulder (7,12). A recorded-beat dressing realization (the T50 bogeyes / T51 mural precedent): tale_sinnoh_sunnyshore 'The Coil in the Lighthouse' + its resolution name the spare coil, tuned to the beacon's new frequency; dressed here as dressing only — no actor, no dialogue, no event. Fully opaque; the town grass is baked in at its measured colours (#2e8f12 / #2e5912). COPPER RINGS ON A CRADLE: unlike any shipped prop (Bridgeport's harbourbell, Repose's eggbasket, Inglenook's poffintin). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T53-BRIGHTSHORE-PLAN.md §5.)
